[1m[38;5;231mShould notifications persist, or only appear live?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mPersisted inbox (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mNotifications are stored with read/unread state. Bell with unread count, openable list. Survives closing the tab.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Live toast only
     [38;5;246mSSE pushes a toast; nothing stored. Thinnest possible skeleton, but you miss anything that arrives while away.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Persisted, badge only
     [38;5;246mStored, but UI is just an unread count that links to filtered tasks. Less UI than a full inbox.[39m
